_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qfOc5n2WxyoQ7kNvwH6p1tv&_nc_oc=Adq_LlA9Nu97ptgA4zXgBSoRX7Qr8ClkXIn9-2j1-aiu-k_pU71AWNDo0faq3F3yJ6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwYC7Jjj8eYG-uETfcYW8pFTpNGE2n8bfSqK2k4jxZb6A&oe=69C12867"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "image.png", "id": "4146366052093130", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982526_4146366055426463_1932917196235881614_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=31kUi1mjwEAQ7kNvwGluyWJ&_nc_oc=AdrbRePMtPLoEmW_w1XeCx2LJR0dbphI1F9Uk16KrK2vG-qa6ylDtba9N06EX37sGuo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzpJBAJAimLAGk4Rc8Ion_6ilnyDPdBUzRFOXxWEaG5zw&oe=69C147FE"}, "display_name": "Phases of the Moon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Phases of the Moon is a three-dimensional poem that you fly through in order to read. It is not an ordinary text, but a place that you visit and quickly get lost in. \n\nThe narrative revolves around a toxic love story told through 60 chapters or 'phases', which intertwine in a cloud of text strings. As the reader and protagonist move closer to the center and ending of the text, its poetic statements crisscross and fuse into a chaotic conclusion.\n\nThe full journey is 20 minutes.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\u2022 Hold the trigger buttons to fly\n\u2022 Control the speed by bending and stretching your arms\n\u2022 You can fly with just a single controller - or both for maximum speed\n\u2022 In the menu you can access the chapter index, switch the color and more\n", "short_description": "Experience a unique form of literature: a three-dimensional poem that you fly through in order to read. Get lost in the landscape of a toxic love story."}]}, "developer_name": "Simon Theis Hansen", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://phasesofthemoon.net/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Simon Theis Hansen", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http